---
const email = "me@jobenas.com";
---

<section class="post-footer">
  <hr />
  <h3>About this site</h3>

  <p>
    I write about engineering problems that only show up once systems grow:
    decaying toolchains, brittle boundaries, and the hidden cost of "just one more workaround."
  </p>

  <p>
    If you’re dealing with similar issues — especially where embedded systems meet cloud tooling —
    feel free to reach out at <a href={`mailto:${email}`}>{email}</a>. I’m more interested in
    discussing real systems than debating abstractions.
  </p>

  <div class="newsletter-signup">
    <h3>Want more?</h3>
    <p>Subscribe for new posts on IoT production problems, embedded systems, and infrastructure that actually works.</p>
    <form
      action="https://buttondown.com/api/emails/embed-subscribe/jobenas"
      method="post"
      target="popupwindow"
      class="embeddable-buttondown-form"
    >
      <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="your@email.com" required />
      <input type="submit" value="Subscribe" />
    </form>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .post-footer {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    opacity: 0.95;
  }
  .post-footer hr {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }
  .post-footer h3 {
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem 0;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }
  .newsletter-signup {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: rgba(var(--gray-light), 40%);
    border-radius: 8px;
  }
  .newsletter-signup h3 {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .newsletter-signup p {
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  .newsletter-signup form {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .newsletter-signup input[type="email"] {
    flex: 1;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;
    border: 1px solid rgb(var(--gray-light));
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  .newsletter-signup input[type="submit"] {
    padding: 0.5rem 1.25rem;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: white;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-weight: 700;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  .newsletter-signup input[type="submit"]:hover {
    background: var(--accent-dark);
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .newsletter-signup form {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
  }
</style>
